      "value": "You can, while a bit limited use Invite+ for that. Also rather than having passwords I would like if they add some kind of permission system where you can allow some of your friends to join at all times, especially if they helped you with the world.\n\nEdit: also I guess you can put a spawn somewhere and block entrance unless you type in the password on your keyboard or in game keypad.",
