      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This password protection for the worlds is really needed in certain cases.\n\nFor me specifically I hate when I decide to cuddle and sleep with someone in there and in the middle I crash. They are asleep so can t accept my invites and if I am on green or blue in friends+ instance I run into risk of being woken up by friends that join and didn t realize what is happening.\n\nAnd that is not the only reason. You can have some private talk with someone and want to people know you are not available and by staying green in password protected world people can see what world you are in and that there is only 2 people so they know you don t wanna be disturbed.\n\nLike I could list a ton of possible combinations where having right status and world setup with password will work wonders for a lot of people and occasions.....sure it can also make some people feel bad that their friends created instance that they are in with other friends but can t join them and all but at least you would know what they are doing and if you know password you could join if not you can always ask. Of course I guess it can be done in a way if you recieve invite the password protection is ignored but being blue wouldn t count to that and all.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
