  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The current options for world permissions aren't always enough. Sometimes you want your friends to be able to join your in-development world and have them let their friends join too, while only limiting it to those you and your friends can trust. Not every person on your friends list or on the friends lists of your friends is trustworthy.",
